### Apple 로그인 nonce 요청 (응답 nonce를 SDK 요청에 그대로 지정)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/apple/challenge

### SDK 응답으로 로그인. 실제 토큰을 파일에 저장하지 않는다.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/apple
Content-Type: application/json

{"identityToken":"{{appleIdentityToken}}","authorizationCode":"{{appleAuthorizationCode}}","challengeToken":"{{appleChallengeToken}}","name":"홍길동"}

### 로그인 수단 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/login-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 등록된 휴대폰으로 연결 인증번호 발송
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/login-methods/sms/send
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 연결 인증번호 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/login-methods/sms/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"{{smsCode}}"}

### 구글 계정 추가
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/login-methods/google
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"idToken":"{{googleIdToken}}","verificationToken":"{{linkVerificationToken}}"}

### Apple 연결 전용 nonce 요청
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/login-methods/apple/challenge
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Apple 계정 추가
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/login-methods/apple
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"identityToken":"{{appleIdentityToken}}","authorizationCode":"{{appleAuthorizationCode}}","challengeToken":"{{appleLinkChallengeToken}}","verificationToken":"{{linkVerificationToken}}"}
